  questions:
  - questionText: "Mik\xE4 on 1 + 1 "
    answer: 2
  - questionText: "Mik\xE4 on 8 * 14 "
    answer: 112
  - questionText: "Mik\xE4 on veden kemialinen kaava "
    answer: H2O
  - questionText: "Mik\xE4 on Benzenen kemikaalinen kaava"
    answer: C6H6
  - questionText: Kuinka monta kertaa isompi Phoenix A on aurinkoon verrattuna
    answer: 423600
  - questionText: "x = \u221A(1 + 2\u221A(1 + 3\u221A(1 + 4\u221A(1 + 5\u221A(1 +
      ...))))) "
    answer: 3
  - questionText: "\u03C1(\u2202u/\u2202t + u \xB7 \u2207u) = -\u2207p + \u03BC\u2207\xB2u
      + f"
    answer: Ei Ratkaisua
